{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9dc39c0d8658edbe865ffc19f6acb496b6ba0a1b6a20133f763dc2b80d336575", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "10dd0fb264dedc4e3a21fe43eeb90677b00c9e3088d68d4ee108e460166e8532", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n爽やかなデザインで、とっても素敵ですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n清爽的设计，真的很棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "b90e1276518547dbadafcb3642e248e2ed618d84b51d26bf681a4a06e9fc295e", "ja": "ただ、えっと……想像していたより、\n水着っぽいですね。肌が見えちゃうっていうか……。", "zh": "不过，那个……比我想象中更像泳装呢。该说是……露出的肌肤有点多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "660078a4e6562c62fa2f44cc06bd40bf3ceee81f9fa580fba9dcb2de31506515", "ja": "プールで使うことも想定して考えたからな。\nでもよく似合ってるよ。衣装も、その髪型も。", "zh": "毕竟也考虑到了在泳池里使用的情况。\n不过真的很适合你。无论是服装，还是那个发型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "6db52f444a8ac527a3158bdafa1275f9f2e6a5444625144baebf6b9087c66d1d", "ja": "本当ですか？　あ、ありがとうございます。\n衣装に合う髪型を考えるの、結構悩んだんです。", "zh": "真的吗？啊，谢谢您。\n为了搭配服装的发型，我可是纠结了好一阵子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "869d98c27a3714ac29f6096c9d315a902be9f15533f1845de5191f8d4302b153", "ja": "色々試してみたんですけど、\n一番似合うのはこのヘアスタイルかなって。", "zh": "试了好几种，觉得这个发型应该是最适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9016dd532e7220cca5278e3f9d7433c6c731d0cd10d06ec72776bca2b8890e58", "ja": "そうだったのか。静香はセンスがいいな！\n可愛いと思うよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。静香，你很有品位嘛！我觉得很可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "28768a93405d5820878438e586cec84eca4b4c06abc9a8e8c1d6a000240f2ed3", "ja": "なっ……ひ、他人事みたいに言わないでください！\n普通なら、プロデューサーが考えることですよ！", "zh": "啊……别、别说得像事不关己一样！这种事本来就该由制作人来想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "68503b2aa00db9f8ff92ab1fc10f93786e23411363db77500fef25b46dbad5aa", "ja": "ま……まあ、センスがいいっていうなら、\nたまには髪型、変えてみてもいいですけど……。", "zh": "不……既然您说很有品位，那我偶尔换个发型也不是不可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7d7fa85c3e6db105d1f8c4a4b2c2c3fa2235e03a41b1ab016c6c553279607fe3", "ja": "静香は髪が長いから、髪型の選択肢も多そうだな。\nその分、手入れとか大変そうだけど……。", "zh": "静香的头发很长，发型的选择应该也很多吧。\n不过相应地，打理起来似乎也挺辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "77863b6871330dfb8619745ac6b8d79317f244957ab023a4dc6b7567b9ce1880", "ja": "まぁ……そうですね。\nどうしても手は掛かっていると思います。", "zh": "嗯……是这样呢。\n我想确实花了不少工夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "d951ac87981ca618efa6ac86333f7be25d5fea6e2a930248cdceef253f178d23", "ja": "でも、ショートカットの娘だって、\n同じくらいお手入れはしているはずですよ。", "zh": "不过，短发的女孩子应该也同样花了不少心思护理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "514b87c78e4e0aa64d7a96a702dbf9a0673896d5fd14f4190c9f5593133b905b", "ja": "このオイルがよかった、こんなケアもある、って\nたまに劇場で情報交換をしていますし。", "zh": "偶尔也会在剧场里交流心得，比如哪种护发油好用、还有这样的护理方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c8974b174c6657276b5dc7391261f8f6abe7206dbda87bcbc73b5d2cad99d392", "ja": "みんな、仕事意識が高くてありがたいな。\nこっちも負けないように頑張らないと……。", "zh": "大家的工作意识都很强，真是帮大忙了。\n我也不能输给你们，得好好加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "66583e80625cbf1d8134f704aaa884f2446aa688d7b0b7c8866c16f8deabb929", "ja": "もちろんです。{$P$}には、\nしっかりしてもらわないと……あっ、そうだ。", "zh": "那是当然。{$P$}要是\n不振作一点可不行……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "09312464f3c7236b8dc58f0ad141aca0d7d78f1aa67cf73f5d974f3ea71f14c8", "ja": "試しに{$P$}も、\nケアしてみたらどうですか？　髪とかお肌とか。", "zh": "要不{$P$}也试着\n保养一下？头发啊、皮肤啊之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b7faa1f6be7a6ee89218181d8b2de159efcf820ebeb4e5b1e04272b67fb2e25d", "ja": "えっ、俺が？", "zh": "欸，我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0264_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "16ca020c3a22a49903340dc09c569a8e02d76f5a958ceeec8240bf2e2a87acc1", "ja": "はい。営業のお仕事とかもあると思いますし、\n見た目って、大事だと思いますよ？", "zh": "是的。您应该也有外勤之类的工作吧，所以我觉得外表还是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
